    <briefdescription>
<para>Common base struct for callable-wrapping operators. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The base of the exception-checking operators, <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1throws__op" kindref="compound">throws_op</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1nothrow__op" kindref="compound">nothrow_op</ref></computeroutput>, which invoke the callable in their constructors. It stores the pre-computed boolean result, and, when the check failed, what was thrown, so that the report can state why (see <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1expression__formatter_1a2835213b70dc5f7b1748a6c27a848108" kindref="member">expression_formatter::append_throw_reason()</ref></computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
